        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Lint: HTML conformance/style fixes (2)]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41771</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41771"/>
        <updated>2025-11-02T05:04:13.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Follow up of <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3572980693" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41754" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/41754/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41754">#41754</a>.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Tag <code class="notranslate">vue</code> code blocks properly</li>
<li>Remove illicit <code class="notranslate">&lt;iframe&gt;</code> children; I know this is for fallback but there's no reason to care about lack of <code class="notranslate">iframe</code> support</li>
<li>Buttons and links should have accessible names</li>
<li>Images should have <code class="notranslate">src</code></li>
<li>Fix invalid nesting, such as <code class="notranslate">&lt;menu&gt;</code> having non-<code class="notranslate">li</code> children</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">&lt;map&gt;</code> need a name, and if it has an id they need to be equal. Also slightly updated the docs for <code class="notranslate">HTMLImageElement.useMap</code> to reflect this</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">id</code> should be valid CSS identifiers</li>
<li>Fix a case where we do <code class="notranslate">&lt;legend role="button"&gt;</code> to use an actual button instead</li>
<li>Properly escape <code class="notranslate">&lt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&gt;</code>; properly add trailing slashes for void elements</li>
<li>Boolean attributes have no value</li>
<li>Remove deprecated attributes</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">street-address</code> is not a valid <code class="notranslate">autocomplete</code> token for <code class="notranslate">&lt;input&gt;</code>; replaced with <code class="notranslate">&lt;textarea&gt;</code></li>
<li>Labels cannot label multiple controls: there are a few cases where we use the pattern <code class="notranslate">&lt;label for="a"&gt;&lt;output&gt;&lt;/output&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id="a"&gt;</code> where we don't actually intend for the <code class="notranslate">output</code> to be a form control, so replaced it with <code class="notranslate">&lt;span&gt;</code> instead</li>
</ul>]]></content>
